{"meta":{"id":"tt27613895","type":"movie","name":"GOAT: La cabra que cambió el juego","imdb_id":"tt27613895","description":"Will, un pequeño cabrito con grandes sueños, tiene la oportunidad única de unirse a los profesionales y jugar al roarball, un deporte de contacto intenso y mixto, dominado por los animales más rápidos y feroces del mundo. A sus nuevos compañeros no les entusiasma tener un pequeño cabrito en su equipo, pero Will está decidido a revolucionar el deporte y demostrar de una vez por todas que los pequeños también pueden jugar al béisbol.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt27613895.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vcM0CWnMGdOo6ty1iyt7zE1jtd6.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wBp1uMew74FaKyR3GCz768Ryod7.png","genres":["Animación","Comedia","Familia"],"releaseInfo":"2026","released":"2026-02-11T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"100 min","imdbRating":"6.6","country":"United States of America","cast":["Caleb McLaughlin","Gabrielle Union","Stephen Curry","Aaron Pierre","Nicola Coughlan","David Harbour","Nick Kroll","Jenifer Lewis","Patton Oswalt","Jelly Roll","Jennifer Hudson","Sherry Cola","Eduardo Franco","Andrew Santino","Bobby Lee","Wayne Knight","Ayesha Curry","Van Van","Rayaan Kamal Khan","Adam Pally","Angel Reese","Joe La Puma","Erin Andrews","Andre Iguodala","A'ja Wilson","Mike Breen","Kevin Love","Dwyane Wade","Tarek Bishara","Aaron Buchsbaum"],"director":["Tyree Dillihay"],"writer":["Airin Budiman","Keely Propp","James W. Suhr","Nicolas Curcio","Peter Chiarelli","Aaron Buchsbaum","Teddy Riley","Chris Tougas","Ian Higginbotham","Matthew Bordenave","Chase Conley","Jarelle Dampier","Yingzhong Hu","Benjamin Jordan Lee","Max Perkins","Steve Walker","Melody Wang","Felix Yang","Joshua E. Perez"],"trailers":[{"source":"2I6sfNgZ0dU","type":"Trailer","name":"Nuevo Tráiler [Doblado]","ytId":"2I6sfNgZ0dU","lang":"es"},{"source":"TmKG-DXdJ28","type":"Trailer","n